          <details class="group relief-panel p-6 cursor-pointer" data-reveal>
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between text-white font-semibold text-lg list-none">
              C'est quoi l'IA souveraine ?
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-alliance-blue transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 shrink-0 ml-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
